Create an official-player starter with declarative particles, authoring instructions and two movement smoke tests in a new or truly empty directory

Usage: game.exe project init [OPTIONS] --name <NAME>

Options:
      --name <NAME>        Project name written to project.unone.json
      --sdk <SDK>          Portable SDK root (otherwise environment or executable-relative discovery)
      --project <PROJECT>  [default: .]
      --json               
  -h, --help               Print help
